# Untracked reference docs from the agent-john workspace.
# These are technical-investigation write-ups that travel with
# the dev environment (the agent's `/workspace` mount) rather than
# the code itself. They live in `docs/` for local reference and
# are NOT tracked in git. To update them, replace the files in
# `docs/` from the latest copy in the agent's workspace.
